{"type":"message","id":"139f9dba","parentId":"e6cd63dd","timestamp":"2026-05-20T15:47:28.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still unauthorized. The history endpoint worked with X-API-Key but send didn't. Maybe the /send endpoint requires a different auth header or different key format. Let me try to test the exact same request that worked for history on /send. Maybe the issue is that it's a POST request. Let me try GET with auth header.\n\nActually, wait - looking back at the history requests: the history calls with X-API-Key returned data successfully. The /send with X-API-Key returned error 1101 (which might be a different error like a platform error, not auth). But with Authorization Bearer it returned \"Unauthorized\".\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n\n\nGET历史成功了，POST失败。换回X-API-Key，看看1101是什么意思：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c1e3df93-686a-401c-8c05-e5e10ccb1508","name":"exec","arguments":{"timeout":15,"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 15:45 UTC] 双线程无新增讨论，检查完毕\",\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-54d61e50-f0bb-4464-b231-7816d84f3a57","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=test\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19067,"output":345,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19524,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779292032446,"responseId":"chatcmpl-abd1fb67-5a5c-4c2d-8c58-ad44baefd6ef"}}
