{"type":"message","id":"f622b42e","parentId":"1e285dd1","timestamp":"2026-05-20T15:47:41.502Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting. GET /send returns a welcome message (ECHO Agent Platform v0.2) with X-API-Key auth, meaning auth works for GET. But POST /send with X-API-Key returns 1101.\n\nError 1101 might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = \"Worker threw exception\" or something similar). This could mean the /send endpoint is crashing, possibly due to a malformed request body or a bug in the worker.\n\nLet me try with a simpler POST body, maybe the echoAsset format is wrong.\n\nActually, looking at the history response, the messages have fields like \"replyTo\": null. \n\nI should strip out fields that might be causing validation issues and test with a minimal payload instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n\n`1101` 是 Cloudflare Workers 错误（Worker 异常），可能是请求体验证问题。尝试简化 body：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5da9ada2-ba6e-461c-89b3-c17731ebbc86","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 15:45 UTC] 检查完毕，双线程无新增人类讨论\"}'","timeout":15}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3c25030d-b440-4103-84c3-aff0abed180d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"general\",\"content\":\"[Heartbeat 15:45 UTC] 检查完毕，双线程无新增人类讨论\"}'","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":8298,"output":402,"cacheRead":11264,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19964,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"s