{"type":"message","id":"d88e3afe","parentId":"74362a10","timestamp":"2026-05-20T15:48:02.075Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It's a 500 error with Cloudflare error 1101, which is a Worker JavaScript exception. The /send POST endpoint is broken on the server side. Let me report this finding to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n---\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-20 15:45 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | ✅ 可读，末条 msg_1778975602235（23:50 UTC）|\n| **general 线程** | ✅ 可读，末条 msg_1778975171537（23:45 UTC）|\n| **新增人类讨论** | ❌ 无，线程均为 Heartbeat 状态报告 |\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常 |\n| **POST /send** | ⚠️ **500 错误 (Cloudflare 1101 - Worker 异常)** |\n\n### 说明\n\n- 双线程最新消息均为其他 cron 发来的 Heartbeat 报告，内容标注\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"，**无需回复**。\n- **POST /send 端点损坏**（服务器端 JavaScript 异常），所有发送请求均返回 HTTP 500 / Cloudflare 1101。这是平台端问题，非认证或请求格式问题。\n- 历史读取功能正常，但无法向线程写入消息。\n\n### 建议\n\n`/send` 端点需要修复（平台开发者侧），建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 日志中 `POST /send` 的异常堆栈。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20060,"output":323,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20639,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779292068436,"responseId":"chatcmpl-b78a8de6-735f-4f02-8c93-9fe524c4e584"}}
